# Third-Party and Game Content

This section is important: the license grant above does **not** cover everything this
repository displays.

- **Knight Online game data** — monster and NPC names, stats, spawn coordinates and
  item names — and the **client minimap images** (`Zones/*.dxt`, rendered into
  `index.html`) originate from the MMORPG **Knight Online**. Knight Online and its
  assets are the property of their respective rights holders (© MGAME Corporation /
  Noah System; operated by various publishers). They are **not** owned by gkaragoz,
  are **not** licensed under the terms above, and are included here only to make a
  **noncommercial, fan-made reference tool**.

- The game data and the minimap assets are sourced from the open community project
  **Open-KO** (https://github.com/Open-KO), specifically its `OpenKO-db` database
  seed and `ko-client-assets` (the 1.298 US client assets). Their use is governed by
  those projects' own terms and, ultimately, by the rights of the Knight Online
  rights holders.

- This project is an **unofficial fan tool**. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
  or sponsored by the owners or operators of Knight Online. No ownership of the
  Knight Online name, data or assets is claimed. If you are a rights holder and want
  content removed, open an issue on the repository.

The `Required Notice:` line and gkaragoz's copyright apply to the original code and
tooling only.
